  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2x + (2)/(x) = 5\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(A + B)³ = A³ + B³ + 3AB(A+B)\n\n**Calculation: **\n\n2x + (2)/(x) = 5\n\n⇒x + (1)/(x) = (5)/(2)\n\n⇒ (x+(1)/(x))³=x³ + (1)/(x³) + 3(x + (1)/(x))\n\n⇒ (5/2)³ = x³+(1)/(x³) + 3 × (5)/(2)\n\n⇒ x³+(1)/(x³) + 2 = (125)/(8) - (15)/(2) + 2\n\n⇒ x³+(1)/(x³) + 2 = (125-60+16)/(8)\n\n⇒ x³+(1)/(x³) + 2 = (81)/(8)\n\n**∴ The correct option is 4**",
